      "writtenOn": "2017-10-23T08:59:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, I think I understand now, got very confused (and accidentally changed the logic in my previous patch), sorry about that.\n\nI see that the original code did not CLEAR_BIT(NPCX_WKEDG(1, NPCX_UART_WK_PORT_N), NPCX_UART_WK_BIT); in gpio2uart, and only SET_BIT in uart2gpio.\n\nBut then I don\u0027t think we need this line, because clock_uart2gpio calls:\nnpcx_uart2gpio();\nthen\nuart_enable_wakeup(1);\n\nWhich does the exact same thing?",
      "parentUuid": "33bc5183_11b2f117",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 62,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 62,
        "endChar": 30
