      "writtenOn": "2017-10-23T08:21:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On npcx5, uart has no ability to wake-up ec from deep sleep. Before ec entering deep-idle, we switched pin-mux from uart to gpio and make sure ec can wake up by a falling edge on RX pin. I don\u0027t think line 99 is necessary since it belongs to gpio not uart. This function, npcx_gpio2uart(), usually is called after ec wake-up from deep idle.",
